 "plain_text_face": "The Quarterly Review\n\nRevenue grew in every region this quarter, and for the first time the growth came mostly from customers who had been with us for more than a year.\n\n• First point, short.\n• Second point, which runs long enough to need a second line at the width used here.\n  1. A numbered step.\n  2. Another numbered step.\n• Third point.\n\nWhat gets measured gets managed, and what gets explained gets trusted.\n\ntotal = sum(rows)\nprint(total)\n\nMethod\n\nEvery figure in this section was taken from the ledger at the close of the quarter and has not been adjusted since.\n\nWhere a number differs from the one reported last time, the difference is explained beside it and the earlier value is kept.\n\nNothing here is a forecast. The next section says what the team expects, and why, and how sure it is.\n\nReaders who want the detail behind a line can open it: each row leads back to the entries it was summed from.\n\nThe appendix lists what was left out and the reason for each omission, so that nothing is absent by accident.\n\nCorrections are welcome and are recorded with the name of whoever made them and the evidence they gave.\n\n\n"
